{"sha": "603fcaf0b4d0dad2982e7f3c1db5a6dbd52805d8601a492a90b6fdc687128816", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:thermodynamic-potentials} 章 --- 热力学势}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermodynamic-potentials:1}", "$F = -nRT\\ln V + f(T)$, $G = nRT\\ln P + g(T)$; $P = -\\partial_VF = nRT/V$,", "$V = \\partial_PG = nRT/P$；$-\\partial_TF = nR\\ln V - f'(T)$，熵为", "$nC_V\\ln T + nR\\ln V + \\text{常数}$，若 $f' = -nC_V\\ln T + \\dots$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermodynamic-potentials:2}", "$\\Delta F = -RT\\ln 10 = \\qty{-5.7}{kJ}$, $\\Delta U = 0$, $\\Delta S = \\qty{19.1}{J/K}$.", "可逆过程：\\qty{5.7}{kJ}，$S_{\\text{c}} = 0$；对抗 \\qty{1}{bar} 外压：\\qty{0.9}{kJ}，", "$S_{\\text{c}} = 19.1 - 900/300 = \\qty{16}{J/K}$；向真空膨胀：不做功，$S_{\\text{c}} =", "\\qty{19.1}{J/K}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermodynamic-potentials:3}", "$\\Delta g = \\Delta h - T\\Delta s$ 其中 $\\Delta h \\approx L$，$\\Delta s \\approx L/T_{\\text{熔}}$。", "在 \\qty{-5}{\\celsius} 时：$g_{\\text{液}} - g_{\\text{冰}} = +\\qty{6.1}{kJ/kg}$，冰", "稳定，液体亚稳（存在过冷）；在 $+\\qty{5}{\\celsius}$ 时：", "\\qty{-6.1}{kJ/kg}，液体稳定 --- 过热的冰未被观察到，其", "表面先熔化。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermodynamic-potentials:4}", "熔化曲线斜率 $\\qty{-1.3e7}{Pa/K}$；汽化曲线斜率 \\qty{3.6}{kPa/K}。\\qty{70}{bar} 时：", "\\qty{-0.5}{K}; \\qty{0.7}{bar}: \\qty{92}{\\celsius}; \\qty{2}{bar}: $\\approx", "\\qty{127}{\\celsius}$（按局部斜率估计；实际为 \\qty{120}{\\celsius}，", "斜率随之增大）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermodynamic-potentials:5}", "(a) 亦有 $(\\partial T/\\partial V)_S = -(\\partial P/\\partial S)_V$ 与", "$(\\partial T/\\partial P)_S = (\\partial V/\\partial S)_P$。(b) $0$；$a/v^2$。(c)", "$\\alpha/\\kappa_T = \\qty{4.6}{bar/K}$; $T\\alpha/\\kappa_T - P \\approx \\qty{1400}{bar}$.", "(d) \\qty{46}{bar}：瓶子爆裂。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermodynamic-potentials:6}", "(a) 由\\cref{thm:b2:thermodynamic-potentials:maxwell}可知。(b) $nR$。(c) 水", "\\qty{29}{J/kg/K}（$0.7\\%$）；铜 \\qty{12}{J/kg/K}（$3\\%$）。(d) 两者之差", "对凝聚态物质可忽略。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermodynamic-potentials:7}", "(a) $-C(L - L_0)$；$0$。(b) $\\Delta S = -C(L - L_0)^2/2 = \\qty{-5e-3}{J/K}$；$Q =", "\\qty{-1.5}{J}$；$W = +\\qty{1.5}{J}$。(c) $+\\qty{0.4}{K}$。(d) $(L - L_0) \\propto", "1/T$: $-9\\%$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermodynamic-potentials:8}", "(a) 物质趋向于 $\\mu$ 较低的一相，即 $\\mu_{\\text{蒸气}} < \\mu_{\\text{液}}$（当 $p <", "p_{\\text{饱和}}$ 时）；湿度 $= p/p_{\\text{饱和}}$。(b) $-RT\\ln 0.5 = \\qty{1.7}{kJ/mol}$", "有利于蒸气一侧。(c) 蒸发只需 $p < p_{\\text{饱和}}$，", "无需沸腾；在 $100\\%$ 时两者化学势相等。(d) 发生在最冷的", "表面上，其 $p_{\\text{饱和}}(T_{\\text{s}})$ 已降至低于空气中的 $p$", "--- 即向夜空辐射散热的表面。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermodynamic-potentials:9}", "(a) 标准。(b) $b = RT_{\\text{c}}/8P_{\\text{c}} = \\qty{4.3e-5}{m^3/mol}$，$a =", "27R^2T_{\\text{c}}^2/64P_{\\text{c}} = \\qty{0.36}{Pa.m^6/mol^2}$。(c) $\\dd g = v\\,\\dd P$，", "在 $T$ 固定且两端 $g$ 相等：$\\int v\\,\\dd P = 0$ 沿", "整个回路。(d) 在 $\\partial_vP > 0$ 处不稳定；两者之间为亚稳态：", "过热液体（暴沸）与过饱和蒸气（", "等待凝结核的雾，云室）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermodynamic-potentials:10}", "(a) $\\dd P/\\dd T = L_{\\text{m}}P/RT^2$：$\\ln(P/P_0) = -(L_{\\text{m}}/R)(1/T - 1/T_0)$。", "(b) \\qty{28}{mbar} 对比 \\qty{23}{mbar} --- $L$ 在 \\qty{20}{\\celsius} 时更大。", "(c) \\qty{820}{Pa} 对比 \\qty{611}{Pa}。(d) $\\partial(\\Delta g/T)/\\partial T = -L/T^2$，", "与沿曲线 $\\Delta g = 0$ 所得斜率相同。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermodynamic-potentials:11}", "(a) 膜两侧 $\\mu$ 相等：$\\mu^\\circ(P + \\Pi) - RTx_{\\text{s}} =", "\\mu^\\circ(P)$，即 $v_{\\text{m}}\\Pi = RTx_{\\text{s}}$，$\\Pi = cRT$。(b) \\qty{27}{bar}。", "(c) 每立方米 $\\Pi V = \\qty{2.7}{MJ} = \\qty{0.75}{kWh}$；实际", "海水淡化装置约为其四倍。(d) 水流向化学势较低处：流入", "溶质浓集的一侧，而盐水则由该侧流出。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:thermodynamic-potentials:12}", "(a) $S = S_0 - k_BL^2/2Na^2$；$f = k_BTL/Na^2$。(b) $k_BT/Na^2 \\propto T$。(c)", "\\qty{1.7e-13}{N}；$1.8 \\times 10^{14}$。(d) $E \\sim nk_BT \\approx \\qty{0.4}{MPa}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:thermodynamic-potentials:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\dd U = T\\dd S + f\\dd L$；$\\dd F = -S\\dd T + f\\dd L$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 对 $\\dd F$ 应用施瓦茨定理。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $f - T\\partial_Tf = CT(L - L_0) - CT(L - L_0) = 0$：内能", "不变；拉力为熵力。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $\\Delta S = \\qty{-5e-3}{J/K}$；$Q = \\qty{-1.5}{J}$；$W = +\\qty{1.5}{J}$；总和", "为零。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $+\\qty{0.4}{K}$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $L - L_0 \\propto 1/T$：\\qty{9.1}{cm}，收缩 \\qty{9}{mm}；", "受热的辐条缩短，轮缘的质心发生移动，轮子", "转动。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $S = S_0 - k_BL^2/2Na^2$；$f = k_BTL/Na^2$；熵的代价", "由 $k_BT$ 支付。", "", "\\textbf{8.} \\qty{1.7e-13}{N}；$1.8 \\times 10^{14}$ 条链。", "", "\\textbf{9.} 其力具有能量性（$\\partial_LU \\ne 0$）；升温", "使键变弱，故 $f$ 随 $T$ 减小。", ""]}